OL,3,AGlastonbury fans share stories from the
OL,4,Aqueue as festival tickets sell out
OL,5,Aafter 40 minutes
OL,6,
OL,7,FTickets for Glastonbury 2027 have sold
OL,8,Fout - the festival announced no passes
OL,9,Fwere left around 09:40 BST
OL,11,FFrom the man with a 100% track record
OL,12,Fto a father-daughter duo that have
OL,13,Fstruck out for 20 years, we've been
OL,14,Fhearing your stories of the ticket dash
OL,16,FA new queuing system was introduced
OL,17,Fthis year, and each registered attendee
OL,18,Fonly got one place in the line - one
OL,19,Ffestival veteran says "it's literally a
OL,20,Flottery"
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
